.. rubric:: Outputs (no circuit port)

A discrete plane wave does not create voltage/current ports or S-parameters.
Use receivers inside/outside the TFSF box for total/scattered fields and
NTFF outputs for scattering/RCS. The incident-wave normalisation is not
antenna-port accepted-power normalisation. See :ref:`output-ntff` and
:ref:`study-plane-wave` for angle/polarisation studies; every observation
direction must be requested in the fixed output definition.
